  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "商用英文(一)",
    "sub_ename": "ENGLISH FOR BUSINESS (1)",
    "describe_ch": "本課程將介紹商務溝通的基本原則和常用詞彙，商用技巧於英文文法(讀、寫、聽、說)，並訓練學生在商業環境中進行正式和非正式的對話。學生將學習如何撰寫商業郵件、報告和簡報，並提高他們的跨文化溝通能力。",
    "describe_eh": "The course will introduce the basic principles of business communication and common vocabulary, covering business skills such as English grammar (reading, writing, listening and speaking), as well as training students in formal and informal dialogue in business situations. Students will learn how to write business emails, reports and presentations and improve cross-cultural communication skills.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
